          "height": 81.375,
          "right": 382
        },
        "float": "none",
        "complete": true,
        "naturalWidth": 111,
        "viewport": 390,
        "captionText": "The greenhouse bus is a component map. Use moisture readings checked against the bed, configure run-time and water limits, verify that water stops on faults and power loss, and retain a manual shutoff."
