          "width": 374,
          "height": 61.03125,
          "right": 382
        },
        "float": "none",
        "complete": true,
        "naturalWidth": 112,
        "viewport": 390,
        "captionText": "Move heat out through a compatible, verified coolant loop. Heat rate uses mass flow in kilograms per second: Q\u0307 = \u1e41 Cp \u0394T. This diagram specifies neither components nor cooling capacity."
      },
